items.informal_description:
Given a box $ B $ in $\iota$-dimensional space and a positive integer $ n $, this is the finite set of all integer-valued functions $
u : \iota 	o \mathbb{Z}$ such that the unit partition box $\prod_{i \in \iota} [ rac{
u(i)}{n},  rac{
u(i)+1}{n}]$ is contained within $ B $. The finiteness follows from the boundedness of $ B $.
